      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "H3 Image — Quick Start / 使用说明",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 Image — Quick Start\n\nRequires **ComfyUI 0.45.0+**. [Model downloads](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/files)\n\n- **Models:** Select the H3 Image model and dedicated image VAE. The H3 video text encoder can be reused.\n- **Text to image / editing:** Leave the Media Loader empty for text-to-image; add reference images for editing, then describe what to change and preserve. Up to 16 references are supported. Use @ to refer to a picture; all enabled pictures participate even without @.\n- **Size:** Choose the output resolution and aspect ratio. Custom lets you enter width and height separately.\n- **Sampling:** 6 steps, CFG 1, euler_ancestral / sgm_uniform, denoise 1.\n- **Prompt optimization:** Configure the API in Advanced, then click the optimization button in the prompt box. API settings are shared with video Easy nodes. To optimize using reference pictures, enable Read reference media and use a vision-capable API model.\n\n---\n\n# H3 图片 — 使用说明\n\n需要 **ComfyUI 0.45.0 或更新版本**。[模型下载](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/files)\n\n- **模型**：选择 H3 Image 主模型和图片专用 VAE，文本编码器可复用视频 H3 的。\n- **文生图 / 编辑**：媒体加载器留空就是文生图；添加参考图后就是编辑，写清要修改和保留的内容即可。最多支持 16 张参考图，可用 @ 指定引用；不写 @ 也会使用全部已启用的图片。\n- **尺寸**：选择生成分辨率和比例，Custom 可分别填写宽、高。\n- **采样**：6 步、CFG 1、euler_ancestral / sgm_uniform、降噪 1。\n- **提示词优化**：在高级选项中配置 API，再点击输入框的优化按钮。API 设置与视频 Easy 共用。需要看图优化时，开启“读取参考素材”，并使用支持图片的 API 模型。"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# H3 Image — Quick Start\n\nRequires **ComfyUI 0.45.0+**. [Model downloads](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/files)\n\n- **Models:** Select the H3 Image model and dedicated image VAE. The H3 video text encoder can be reused.\n- **Text to image / editing:** Leave the Media Loader empty for text-to-image; add reference images for editing, then describe what to change and preserve. Up to 16 references are supported. Use @ to refer to a picture; all enabled pictures participate even without @.\n- **Size:** Choose the output resolution and aspect ratio. Custom lets you enter width and height separately.\n- **Sampling:** 6 steps, CFG 1, euler_ancestral / sgm_uniform, denoise 1.\n- **Prompt optimization:** Configure the API in Advanced, then click the optimization button in the prompt box. API settings are shared with video Easy nodes. To optimize using reference pictures, enable Read reference media and use a vision-capable API model.\n\n---\n\n# H3 图片 — 使用说明\n\n需要 **ComfyUI 0.45.0 或更新版本**。[模型下载](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3-Image/files)\n\n- **模型**：选择 H3 Image 主模型和图片专用 VAE，文本编码器可复用视频 H3 的。\n- **文生图 / 编辑**：媒体加载器留空就是文生图；添加参考图后就是编辑，写清要修改和保留的内容即可。最多支持 16 张参考图，可用 @ 指定引用；不写 @ 也会使用全部已启用的图片。\n- **尺寸**：选择生成分辨率和比例，Custom 可分别填写宽、高。\n- **采样**：6 步、CFG 1、euler_ancestral / sgm_uniform、降噪 1。\n- **提示词优化**：在高级选项中配置 API，再点击输入框的优化按钮。API 设置与视频 Easy 共用。需要看图优化时，开启“读取参考素材”，并使用支持图片的 API 模型。"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
